# Never commit real values. Every file matching .env* is ignored by Git, except this one.

# --- .env.local (the site) ---
# Address of the Convex deployment that stores ticks, notes and questions for /learning.
# Without it the page still renders the plan, read-only and with no progress.
# Running `npm run convex:dev` writes this for a local test backend.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL=

# --- .env.convex-prod (only for pushing backend changes to production) ---
# A production deploy key from the Convex dashboard, used by `npm run convex:deploy`.
# CONVEX_DEPLOY_KEY=
